This mod must be treated as standalone, as is, and with this license always included.

1. DISTRIBUTION
It is NOT permitted to include this mod in other projects such as modpacks, nor to re-upload it
anywhere else. The mod is updated regularly - a copy inside a modpack or a re-upload quickly
becomes an outdated version. Modpacks and their installers may link to the official page instead:
https://github.com/Mickub2001/AdvancedFireflies/releases

It is not allowed to include this mod as part of another mod with the same purpose, as this makes
people think the other mod is part of this one.

2. YOUR OWN FILES ARE WELCOME
Group files (GroupsSettings\*.ini), settings (.ini) and patterns (patterns\*.txt) that you make or
change - including ones based on the files of this mod - may be shared freely. Share only these
files, not the other files of this mod (such as the .asi or .fxs files); anyone who wants to use
them downloads the mod from the official page.
Screenshots, videos and streams showing the mod are welcome too - please credit the author and link
the official page.

3. CODE
The source code of AdvancedFireflies is not public. The author may give access to it to persons he
authorises; such access does not allow publishing or passing on the code.
It is not permitted to decompile, disassemble or otherwise reverse-engineer AdvancedFireflies.asi
or FxResetFix.asi, to modify or patch them, or to reuse any part of them (code, data, generated
textures) in other projects - except as far as the applicable law allows it regardless of this
license.

If you want to use this mod as part of a bigger project (total conversion, total overhaul), or you
need access to the code for compatibility work, please get in touch.

4. NO WARRANTY
The mod is provided as is, without warranty of any kind. Use it at your own risk.
